        },
        {
          "text": "Veva wa Mwiaiĩ Yeova e ĩũlũ wakwa; nũndũ Yeova nĩwambĩtĩkĩsye mauta nĩtavye ala auu ũvoo mũseo; nũndũmĩte nove ala me na ngoo ndũlĩku, na nĩtavan’ye ũthasyo kwa ala atave, na nĩmavingũĩe kolokolo ala movetwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
