        },
        {
          "text": "Na makaaka kũla kwaanangĩkie tene, makookĩlya kũla kwaekiwe mbee, na makatũngĩĩa ndũa ila syaĩ maanzo, kũla kwaekiwe nĩ nzyawa nyingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        },
